e, draw 1 card, then put 1 card from your hand on the bottom of your deck.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":2,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-004","name":"Redjaw Raider","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"4/5","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round Redjaw Raider deals combat damage, it gains +1 maximum HP permanently without restoring HP.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":4,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-005","name":"Woundrunner","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/4","rules":"Bloodied - Woundrunner has +2 STR while attacking an already-damaged enemy creature.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":4,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-006","name":"Mercy Eater","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/6","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round another friendly Moondemon restores HP, Mercy Eater gains +1 STR this round and takes 1 damage.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":2,"hp":6,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-007","name":"Moonclaw Duelist","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/6","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round Moonclaw Duelist survives creature combat and remains Bloodied, it may immediately make one additional attack.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":4,"hp":6,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-008","name":"Veinbreaker","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/5","rules":"Bloodied - Before Veinbreaker attacks, you may deal 1 damage to it. If you do, it gains +3 STR for that combat.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":5,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-009","name":"Hunger Matriarch","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/8","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round another Bloodied friendly Moondemon deals damage, restore 1 additional HP to that creature after its universal restore.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":4,"hp":8,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-010","name":"Nightpack Alpha","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/7","rules":"Bloodied - Other Bloodied friendly Moondemons have +1 STR.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":5,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-011","name":"Eclipse Ravager","type":"Creature","cost":8,"resource":1,"statsText":"6/8","rules":"Bloodied - Whenever Eclipse Ravager destroys an enemy creature in combat, deal 1 damage to every other enemy creature. Eclipse Ravager is the source of that damage.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":6,"hp":8,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-012","name":"Moonfang Sovereign","type":"Creature","cost":9,"resource":1,"statsText":"7/9","rules":"Bloodied - Moonfang Sovereign deals +3 damage on direct attacks. After it attacks, deal 1 damage to it.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":7,"hp":9,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-013","name":"Open the Vein","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Deal 1 damage to a friendly Moondemon. Bloodied - If that creature is Bloodied after the damage resolves, it gains +3 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-014","name":"Scent of Blood","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a friendly Moondemon. Bloodied - If it is Bloodied, its next damage dealt this round is increased by 2.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-015","name":"Feed the Pack","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Restore a total of 3 HP divided among friendly Moondemons. Bloodied - For each Bloodied target, you may convert 1 point of that healing into +1 maximum HP permanently without restoring that point of HP.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-016","name":"Red Feast","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a Bloodied friendly Moondemon. It deals 1 damage to an enemy creature. Bloodied - If it remains Bloodied after its universal restore, it gains +2 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-017","name":"Pain Is Proof","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a friendly Moondemon. Bloodied - If it is Bloodied, it gains +1 STR this round for every 2 HP it is missing, maximum +4 STR.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-018","name":"No Quarter","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a Bloodied friendly Moondemon and a damaged enemy creature. Bloodied - The friendly creature may immediately attack that enemy. After the attack and any healing, deal 1 damage to the attacker.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-019","name":"Blood in the Water","type":"Trap","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"After an enemy creature takes damage and survives, Bloodied - Choose a Bloodied friendly Moondemon. Its next attack this round gains +2 STR for that combat.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-020","name":"Last Bite","type":"Trap","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"When a Bloodied friendly Moondemon is destroyed by an enemy creature, deal 2 damage to that enemy. Bloodied - Another Bloodied friendly Moondemon gains +2 maximum HP permanently without restoring HP.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-021","name":"Goremane Pup","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/3","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round Goremane Pup takes damage, it gains +1 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":2,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-022","name":"Crimson Surgeon","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/5","rules":"Bloodied - Once per round, deal 1 damage to another friendly Moondemon. That creature gains +1 maximum HP permanently without restoring HP and +1 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":2,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-023","name":"Dusk Butcher","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"4/5","rules":"Bloodied - When Dusk Butcher attack